### Third-Party Shader Notices & Attributions

This repository includes, adapts, and builds upon shaders and transitions from the following open-source projects and authors:

#### 1. liixini/shaders
* **Source:** https://github.com/liixini/shaders
* **License:** MIT License (Copyright (c) 2026 liixini)
* **Description:** Base shader collection and initial transition adaptations, originally ported to niri.
* **Adapted for Hyprland/Wayland by:** Jan H.

#### 2. gl-transitions
* **Source:** https://github.com/gl-transitions/gl-transitions
* **License:** MIT License (Copyright (c) Gaëtan Renaudeau)
* **Ported to niri by:** liixini
* **Adapted for Hyprland/Wayland by:** Jan H.
* **Used in:** `circle`, `ripple` and related geometric transitions.

#### 3. skwd-wall
* **Source:** https://github.com/skwd-org/skwd-wall
* **License:** MIT License
* **Ported to niri by:** liixini
* **Adapted for Hyprland/Wayland by:** Jan H.
* **Used in:** `bounce`, `colour-distance`, `crazy-parametric`, `crosshatch`, `crosswarp`, `directional`, `directional-wipe`, `fadecolor`, `flyeye`, `heat-melt`, `ink-splash`, `inkwell-drop`, `morph`, `overexposure`, `perlin`, `pixelfade-wave`, `plasma-flow`, `polar-function`, `polka-dots-curtain`, `randomsquares`, `soft-warp-fade`, `static-fade`, `voronoi-shatter`, `wave-warp`.

#### 4. XorDev Shaders
* **Author:** @XorDev (https://x.com/XorDev)
* **Ported to niri by:** liixini
* **Adapted for Hyprland/Wayland by:** Jan H.
* **Used in:** `heavenly`, `ionize`, `nebula1`, `starfield` (procedural visual algorithms).

#### 5. Star Nest
* **Author:** Pablo Roman Andrioli (Kali)
* **License:** MIT License
* **Ported to niri by:** liixini
* **Adapted for Hyprland/Wayland by:** Jan H.
* **Used in:** `astral`

#### 6. Matrix Digital Rain
* **Ported to niri by:** liixini
* **Adapted for Hyprland/Wayland by:** Jan H.
* **Used in:** `matrix` (procedural digital rain effect).
